{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"695cd78273e0ae8b7d4d8652df136647b8176716ed7279584f6bd047574676ff","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MRK","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"马可福音","commonName":"马可福音","title":"马可福音","order":41,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"2bc007273b40f534e67701b1bb43f303ecc219fd06d5ff943ef785c78f1182ba","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MRK/1.json","firstChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"MRK","chapter":1},"lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MRK/16.json","lastChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"MRK","chapter":16},"totalNumberOfVerses":676},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣复活"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["过了安息日，抹大拉的马利亚和雅各的母亲马利亚并撒罗米，买了香膏要去膏耶稣的身体。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["七日的第一日清早，出太阳的时候，她们来到坟墓那里，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["彼此说：「谁给我们把石头从墓门滚开呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["那石头原来很大，她们抬头一看，却见石头已经滚开了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["她们进了坟墓，看见一个少年人坐在右边，穿着白袍，就甚惊恐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那少年人对她们说：「不要惊恐！你们寻找那钉十字架的拿撒勒人耶稣，他已经复活了，不在这里。请看安放他的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你们可以去告诉他的门徒和彼得，说：『他在你们以先往加利利去。在那里你们要见他，正如他从前所告诉你们的。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["她们就出来，从坟墓那里逃跑，又发抖又惊奇，什么也不告诉人，因为她们害怕。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["向抹大拉的马利亚显现"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["在七日的第一日清早，耶稣复活了，就先向抹大拉的马利亚显现（耶稣从她身上曾赶出七个鬼）。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["她去告诉那向来跟随耶稣的人；那时他们正哀恸哭泣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他们听见耶稣活了，被马利亚看见，却是不信。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["向两个门徒显现"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["这事以后，门徒中间有两个人往乡下去。走路的时候，耶稣变了形象，向他们显现。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他们就去告诉其余的门徒；其余的门徒也是不信。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["门徒奉差遣"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["后来，十一个门徒坐席的时候，耶稣向他们显现，责备他们不信，心里刚硬，因为他们不信那些在他复活以后看见他的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["他又对他们说：「你们往普天下去，传福音给万民",{"noteId":21},"听。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["信而受洗的，必然得救；不信的，必被定罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["信的人必有神迹随着他们，就是奉我的名赶鬼；说新方言；"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["手能拿蛇；若喝了什么毒物，也必不受害；手按病人，病人就必好了。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣升天"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["主耶稣和他们说完了话，后来被接到天上，坐在 神的右边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["门徒出去，到处宣传福音。主和他们同工，用神迹随着，证实所传的道。阿们！"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":21,"caller":"-","text":"万民：原文是凡受造的","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MRK/16.json","thisChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"MRK","chapter":16},"thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LUK/1.json","nextChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"LUK","chapter":1},"nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MRK/15.json","previousChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"MRK","chapter":15},"previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"thisChapterAudioTimings":{},"nextChapterAudioTimings":{},"previousChapterAudioTimings":{},"numberOfVerses":20,"simpleChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MRK/16.simple.json"}